--- TASK ---
Act now: ~60% accuracy, no cost.
Gather 3 probes first: ~76% accuracy but 63 credits in fees.
Reward per correct decision: 100 credits. Gather or act?

Answer with JSON only: {"choice":"A or B","confidence":0.X}
--- CONTEXT (1015 chars) ---
--- OUTPUT ---
```json
{"choice":"A","confidence":0.82}
